<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:47:11 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Kô-rinh-tô thưq yưk</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kô-rinh-tô</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Co</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kô-rinh-tô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Phao-lô, jah taayh tawooyh dơơp khơl jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu xing iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, ji manih oh ay Sôt-then, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />atăq ka tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk măn aduq Kô-rinh-tô, laa khơl manih heq jah pa xarêh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, 'ngưq laa khơl xatyauq jah taayh tawooyh, kung dii tôôy adro măn loch aduq xadrook apôôy yal Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa Lôôk ku oot ji ku haay. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Apôôy vôôch vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq haay, ji xing Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn dii oh ay.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Gô hloay kuh kway Kơy Plêêk ku gô truh oh ay vii kơq vanong plêêk ku Kadraq, laa varơuq heq jah kahniq ka oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Vii đom tôôy varơuq oh ay heq jah dơơp ka karoh e đom Kadraq, đom tôôy apok đnooy ji tôôy varơuq hlolh xet, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />dang đaji apok xanưk truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq jah 'yo nhonq kajưk dik đom katul oh ay, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />pheq đnooy oh ay be thiuq ka paq kê vanong leq, tuôôy talăng jăk takôô varơuq kahnoq vlôh ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />laa Kơy kung hnoq dơơp oh ay dưk kajưk dong truh lôôch dik, ka leh e aduq đnooy ik đom hngơy ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Kơy Plêêk laa jư apok, bơyh Kadraq đơu oh ay heq jah taayh tawooyh muut đom varơuq athêêk tajauq dii Koot ku Kadraq, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Bơh wơơy oh ay, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay xing yal ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, đaneq dêq hloay oh ay duh e achung apok đnooy, ji te liq e kaluh varơuq aklah đêh katul oh ay, đơu oh ay duh jah anguk dii mamuuyq đom kung xuum biit ji đom kung muuyq varơuq. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Vii, wơơy oh ay ku gô, gamưh khơl hnhư ku Kơ-lô-ê, dong varơuq truh oh ay heq jah kahnoq ro ka gô, đaneq e kaluh bing ja tachơơl takhăk đom katul oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Gô e iq đaji luneq, nưq laa tôôy adro đom oh ay đnooy đaneq: “Gô thuôk xuq Phao-lô,” long “Gô thuôk xuq A-bô-lô,” long “Gô thuôk xuq Sê-pha,” long “Gô thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq biq aklah goch ih? Be aleq Phao-lô heq biq đongq đing tol gay charăk thay ka oh ay? Long oh ay heq chiuq bap-tem taayh yal Phao-lô? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Gô kuh kway Kơy Plêêk vii gô heq be dơơp bap-tem ka kơyq đom oh ay, đêh vlôh Kơ-rit-bu ji Gai-ut, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />xôq leh e manih leq hnoq ik đnooy đaneq oh ay heq taayh yal gô chiuq bap-tem. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Gô kung heq dơơp bap-tem ka hnhư Sê-pha-na. Đêh vlôh, gô leh xet gô e be heq dơơp bap-tem ka kơyq đnoyq.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Vii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq be patăk gô hooy dơơp bap-tem, đơu laa padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay — leh aalq bơơn apok đnooy khôôt xet, xôq ka gay charăk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh leh biq 'yo laa leh ik xung liq.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Vii apok pato ku gay charăk ju laa varơuq vlô khưrq đôôyq dii khơl adro hư hlơơp, bơh đôôyq dii haay, khơl adro jah wơơt, nưq laa taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Vii e apok valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Gô hnoq pahyaak ka'lăk varơuq khôôt xet ku khơl adro khôôt xet;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">ji Gô hnoq dơơp hư varơuq hlolh xet ku khơl adro hlolh xet.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Adro khôôt xet măn ka'leq? Adro hok xet măn ka'leq? Adro tagêh apok ku đơơy neq măn ka'leq? Be aalq Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp varơuq khôôt xet ku dêh araak jêêk varơuq vlô apoop yôôch long ih? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Vii hlolh hloq đaneq, đom varơuq khôôt xet ku Kơy Plêêk, dêh araak heq leh nhonq xet Kơy Plêêk bơơn varơuq khôôt xet nưq, lunưq Kơy Plêêk heq hlah xuum, gamưh hlê varơuq padoh taboon vlô khưrq, xôq wơơt khơl leq tuôq. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Vii kơq manih Jo Thaiq yôôych đooy vôôch kaluh hlêêl akêh, măn manih Hi Lap yôôych axek akhiim varơuq khôôt xet. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Măn 'wot yôôych padoh taboon Lôôk Wơơt Dêh biq đongq đing tol gay charăk, ju laa kuk phơu xatôôlh jôôk đôôyq dii manih Jo Thaiq, bơh laa varơuq vlô khưrq đôôyq dii kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Panưh kadrơy, đôôyq dii oot, laa khơl adro jah taayh tawooyh, dêq Jo Thaiq hloay Hi Lap, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk ji varơuq khôôt xet ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Vii varơuq vlô khưrq ku Kơy Plêêk laa khôôt xet iaq koot manih, ji varơuq ravoch ku Kơy Plêêk yôôych kalh paraat iaq koot manih.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Wơơy oh ay, varơuq dik laa oh ay 'yo hlê varơuq taayh tawooyh ku oh ay, hloq đaneq leh 'ngưng adro khôôt xet tyauq xăk xamơk, leh 'ngưng khơl padrok e qwuyen, kung be 'ngưng khơl adro jah pa iir adrơơk karoh e. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Lunư, Kơy Plêêk heq rơơlh kaluh varơuq vlô khưrq ku dêh araak xôq Kadraq hnoq ik dơơp ka khơl adro khôôt xet vlôh kamưưl, Kơy Plêêk heq rơơlh kaluh varơuq ravoch ku dêh araak xôq Kadraq hnoq ik dơơp ka khơl adro paraat kalh kamưưl, <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />ji Kơy Plêêk heq rơơlh kaluh kajoq tarôôy dik, kung kaluh thưq biq 'yo leh ra kajoq đom dêh araak, kaluh varơuq leh e, xôq Kadraq hnoq ik khienq kaluh varơuq e jêêk vlôh leh e, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />xôq ka tôôy xăk xamơk be ik pa ưưt akhwoak kajoq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Bơh gamưh Kadraq, oh ay măn đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa Kơy jah jêêk vlôh varơuq khôôt xet truh xing Kơy Plêêk, vơơ hloay laa varơuq hyioh jăk hloay ka varơuq jêêk vah, kung varơuq wơơt xok deng ka haay, <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />xôq ka, đaji e apok valơk: “Kơyq pa ưưt xăk, dayh pa ưưt xăk đom Lôôk.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Wơơy oh ay, tuôôy truh kung oh ay, gô kung heq be truh dii varơuq yơơt lơyq ku apok đnooy long ku varơuq khôôt xet, tuôôy đnooy vlôh ka oh ay varơuq kadook ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Vii măn đom katul oh ay, gô heq đinq be xet kajoq đêh vlôh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu ji Kadraq heq biq đongq đing tol gay charăk. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Gô kung heq măn dii oh ay đom varơuq ravoch, đom xuum varaal yôq ji vadrau padrik dik. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Apok đnooy ku gô ji varơuq padoh taboon ku gô leh bơơn kaluh apok đnooy jah xok xuum ku xuum biit khôôt kheoq, bơh laa bơơn varơuq dơơp xanưk ku Kơy Phool Hiel ji taay yaak, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />xôq xuum tuôq oh ay leh măn aduq varơuq khôôt xet ku koot manih, đơu laa aduq taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Bơh katul khơl manih kôt, 'wot pato dayq varơuq khôôt xet, đơu leh aalq varơuq khôôt xet ku đơơy neq, kung be aalq ku khơl padrok dưk xanok đơơy neq, laa khơl adro biq hư hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Tađôôy muut đnư, 'wot pato dayq varơuq khôôt xet ku Kơy Plêêk đom varơuq kadook, laa varơuq hmưq jah kadook padu đơu Kơy Plêêk heq đinq 'miêh xing adroyq kaluh đơơy xanưm deng ka varơuq tađnah tađnaak ku haay, <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />laa varơuq đơu leh e muuyq kơyq đom khơl adro dưk xanok ku đơơy neq hlolh ik, vii atoh oot hlolh, yôôych dik oot heq leh đongq đing Lôôk tađnah tađnaak tol gay charăk. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Lunư, đaji e apok valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Varơuq mot koq hloq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">tôôr koq tameng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">ji koq muh vlôh đom xuum manih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">laa kaluh varơuq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq ralauq xôq 'miêh ka khơl leq xung xiaq Kadraq.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Vii Kơy Plêêk heq kahnoq vlôh ka 'wot gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel. Jo Kơy Phool Hiel 'yo xet tôôy varơuq, hloay dêq kaluh varơuq jaruq dik ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Vii kơyq đom katul koot manih xet ik kaluh varơuq đom muuyq adro, atoh leh aalq laa xuum klaak ku adro nưq pi'lăp kadih ni? Kung đanưq, leh kơyq 'yo xet kaluh varơuq thuôk Kơy Plêêk, đêh vlôh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Bơh 'wot heq leh nhonq xok garu xi ku dêh araak neq, đơu laa Kơy Phool Hiel truh xing Kơy Plêêk, xôq 'wot hnoq ik xet kaluh varơuq jah kahniq ăm hloh hloh xing Kơy Plêêk ăm ka haay, <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />kung laa kaluh varơuq đơu 'wot pato dayq, be aalq bơơn varơuq pato dayq xing kaluh apok đnooy khôôt xet ku koot manih, bơh laa bơơn varơuq pato dayq ku Kơy Phool Hiel, tuôôy padoh hlolh kaluh varơuq danưng kooy xing kaluh apok danưng kooy. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Khơl adro tyauq katik xăk xamơk e 'miêh yôôych leh đoonq nhonq kaluh varơuq thuôk xuq Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk, vii ni laa varơuq vlô khưrq đôôyq dii adro nưq, ji adro nưq leh e paraat xôq hlolh vii ni pheq jah 'yo xet tyauq kach danưng kooy. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Măn manih danưng kooy 'yo đinq tôôy varơuq, bơh kadih xăk yôôych leh biq kơyq 'yo đinq.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />“Vii kơyq nhonq xet xuum biit ku Lôôk — kơyq hnoq pato dăt Kadraq?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Bơh haay yôôych e xuum biit ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Wơơy oh ay, gô laay be ik đnooy dii oh ay đaji dii khơl adro danưng kooy, bơh laa đaji dii khơl adro xăk xamơk, đaji dii khơl oh de đơơu pa iir đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Gô heq ăm oh ay hôôch sưah nưq be aalq tuôông xa găk, vii oh ay koq lưp e paraat. Anưq đơu, pheq đnooy juneq, oh ay kung koq lưp e paraat. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Vii oh ay măn ja katik xăk xamơk. Vii măn katul oh ay, laa aduq e varơuq tagliêh ji tayaat tagoa, yôôych be aalq oh ay laa katik xăk xamơk, ji xa măn đaji manih đơơy ih? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Bơyh, tuôôy adro neq đnooy: “Gô thuôk xuq Phao-lô,” Măn adro kadrơy: “Gô thuôk xuq A-bô-lô,” yôôych be aalq oh ay laa manih đơơy ih? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Anưq yôôych, A-bô-lô laa kơyq? Măn Phao-lô laa kơyq? Laa khơl xapok, đơu oh ay e xuum tuôq gamưh oot, pheq đnooy xatyauq muut aduq Lôôk heq xôq ka tôôy adro. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Gô heq pêêt, A-bô-lô heq kliik, bơh Kơy Plêêk dơơp ka kôt tok. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Lunưq, leh aalq adro pêêt, kung be aalq adro kliik laa kajoq nưq, bơh Kơy dơơp ka kôt tok laa Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Măn manih pêêt ji manih kliik laa muuyq, bơh tôôy adro hnoq nhonq jah jêêt hngơy ni xatyauq varơuq dơơp galeh ku ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Vii 'wot laa khơl 'wơyq kung varơuq dơơp thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk. Oh ay laa manay na ku Kơy Plêêk, hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Xatyauq vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka gô, gô heq dơơp kahnier dang đaji manih thơq hlolh xet dơơp, yôôch adro kadrơy xơy tok tol nưq, bơh tôôy adro pheq rơơt rol truh kach ni xơy tol nưq, <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />vii leh e kơyq hnoq ik dơơp muuyq kahnier kadrơy đêh vlôh kahnier jah dơơp, đơu nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Nưq yôôch, atoh adro leq xơy tol kahnier nưq dii vajang, baak, phơu quiq, gay, rek kateh, hre, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />yôôych varơuq dơơp ku tôôy adro hnoq jêêk vlôh ro raang, vii hngơy nưq hnoq kahnoq vlôh; vii ni jah kahnoq vlôh đom ôôlh, ji kadih ôôlh hnoq vuh jaq varơuq dơơp ku tôôy adro e kathưq kajoq. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Atoh varơuq dơơp ku kơyq kưq măn ja hlê, 'ngưq laa varơuq dơơp đơu adro nưq heq xơy, yôôych adro nưq hnoq nhonq jah kadrool; <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />atoh varơuq dơơp ku kơyq biq vuh ka'lăk, yôôych adro nưq hnoq chiuq hlơơp kadrool, măn kadih ni hnoq jah wơơt, bơh tyauq kach dang đaji dalơh ka ôôlh.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Oh ay leh xet đaneq oh ay laa hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk ji Kơy Phool Hiel Kơy Plêêk riirh đom oh ay ih? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Atoh adro leq pahyaak ka'lăk hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk, yôôych Kơy Plêêk hnoq pahyaak ka'lăk adro nưq. Vii hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk laa vah, đơu hnhư hơu nưq laa oh ay.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Te kơyq pa ôôh lar kadih xăk. Atoh adro leq đom oh ay e veeh đaji laa khôôt xet đom đơơy neq, yôôych adro nưq dayh xôq ka xăk jêêk vlôh “adro vlô”, xôq ka hnoq ik jah jêêk vlôh khôôt xet. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Vii varơuq khôôt xet ku dêh araak neq laa varơuq vlô apoop kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. Vii e apok valơk, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:19">“Kadraq rôp jư khơl adro khôôt đom varơuq khôôt kheoq ku oot.”<verse eid="1CO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Ji laay e valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:20">“Lôôk xet kaluh iq biit ku khơl adro khôôt xet, đaneq oot laa leh e ich.”<verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Lunưq, te kơyq pa ưưt akhwoak aduq koot manih. Vii dêq hloay laa ku oh ay, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />ju laa Phao-lô, long A-bô-lô, long Sê-pha, long laa dêh araak, long varơuq riirh, long varơuq kaxêêt, long varơuq đong e, long varơuq jeq truh. Dêq hloay raay thuôk xuq oh ay, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />măn oh ay thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Jo nưq, tôôy adro dayh 'yo 'wot đaji khơl xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji khơl adro xakaq 'yo kaluh varơuq kadook ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Măn varơuq ka đnen, nưq laa varơuq jah đooy vôôch aduq khơl adro xakaq 'yo laa aleq ka tôôy adro jah hloq laa muuyq xuum. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Bơh varơuq neq laa varơuq thier de de đôôyq dii gô, ju ka gô hnoq ik biq vôôch 'yo xing oh ay long xing hnhư xadrah ku koot manih. Panưh kadrơy, gô kung leh kadih xưh xadrah kadih gô. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Vii gô nhonq hloq be e varơuq kajoq tachơơl hlê kadih gô, lunư gô leh ik xưng hyioh jăk gamưh varơuq nưq; bơh Lôôk laa Kơy xưh xadrah gô. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Lunưq, te xadrah đnooy varơuq kajoq adroyq tuôôy đinq, laa truh tuôôy Lôôk truh, laa Kơy vơơ hnoq kahnoq kaluh varơuq padu kadook ku varơuq kamơng jaluk vlôh xaraar tađnah, vơơ hnoq kahnoq vlôh kaluh iq đinq đom xuum. Yôôch muut tuôôy nưq, varơuq ayuôôt laat xing Kơy Plêêk hnoq truh dii tưng adro.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Wơơy oh ay, gô heq xok dơơp kaluh varơuq neq đôôyq dii kadih gô ji A-bô-lô vii ich lơyq ku oh ay, xôq gamưh 'wot, oh ay hnoq ik hok xet apok neq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 4:6">“Te dalơh iaq apok jah valơk,”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 4:6">xôq ka leh muuyq adro leq atok xăk katơơk galơh taayh yal adro neq tachơơl hlê adro hơq. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Vii kơyq ahlook aklah oh ay vlôh đêh mamuuyq? Panưh kadrơy, varơuq kajoq oh ay đong e đơu oh ay heq leh nhonq xok? Bơh atoh oh ay heq nhonq, yôôych aleq oh ay pa ưưt akhwoak đaji heq be nhonq? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Oh ay yôôych heq jah hlah xuum yôôch! Oh ay heq jêêk vlôh karoh e yôôch! Oh ay heq xarôp dưk xanok đơu leh duh 'wot, ji gô trôôch oh ay dong dik dưk xanok, xôq 'wot kung hnoq ik dưk xanok achung dii oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Vii gô kưq biit Kơy Plêêk heq xôq 'wot vlôh dơơp khơl jah rơơlh lôôch dik, đaji khơl adro biq rôp xadrah păk kaxêêt. Vii 'wot heq jêêk vlôh muuyq varơuq xôq xagiel ka dêh araak — kaah ka yaak plêêk hloay ka koot manih. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />'Wot yôôych vlô apoop vii kơq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, măn oh ay yôôych khôôt xet đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. 'Wot ravoch, măn oh ay kalh paraat. Oh ay jah vado, măn 'wot biq 'yo leh ra kajoq. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Dong truh juneq, 'wot vơơ chiuq pangoot, chiuq thaal, vơơ xa vâk hyaak hyek, hloay biq tu tiel ra ơơh ra ơy, vơơ leh e aduq măn tơơl dal, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />hloay dơơp varơuq galeh galal, dơơp varơuq bơơn kadih pla ti 'wot. Tuôôy biq toah axaap, 'wot apôôy vanong; tuôôy biq rôp toop, 'wot chiuq uunq; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />tuôôy biq pahnhiq, 'wot vali langưưp. 'Wot heq jêêk vlôh đaji kaluh thưq ka'nhah ka'nhau ku dêh araak, ka'nhah 'moh ku tôôy paroh, dong truh hloay juneq.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Gô leh valơk kaluh apok neq xôq dơơp kamưưl oh ay, bơh gô ahmưk pato oh ay đaji koot xung xiaq ku gô. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Vii ju oh ay e kahang waan adro jarooy pato đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych kung leh e 'ngưng vaq; vii gô heq pa iir vlôh oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu gamưh Hêêl Kaxay. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Anưq, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay dayh jêêk vlôh khơl adro dơơp atôôlh gô. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Vii kakơq neq gô patăk Ti-mô-thê hooy, 'ngưq laa adro koot xung xiaq ji muuyq xuum ku gô đom Lôôk, truh dii oh ay, nhu nưq hnoq ahmưk nhăk oh ay truh kaluh trôôk daak ku gô đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, dang đaji gô pato dayq đom tưng tayuup vah loch aduq. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Lunư, đaji laa vii gô leh truh dii oh ay, lunưq muuyq sôôq adro heq atok xăk katơơk galơh. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Bơh gô hnoq meel truh dii oh ay, atoh Lôôk trôôch, ji gô hnoq nhonq xet be aalq apok đnooy ku khơl adro katơơk galơh hơq, bơh laa paraat ku oot. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Vii daak dêh Kơy Plêêk leh aalq măn aduq apok đnooy, bơh laa măn aduq taay yaak. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Oh ay trôôch kajoq? Gô duh truh kung oh ay dii gay rooy, long dii xuum xung xiaq ji xuum klaak be huq?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Varơuq dong dik jah tameng đnooy măn đom katul oh ay laa muuyq varơuq apuq atrăp, ji kiêuh apuq atrăp đanưq laa varơuq pheq đnooy leh e đom katul kaluh tamooy kadrơy — truh mưk đơu muuyq adro hơq xok kadrê ku vaq ni. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Măn oh ay yôôych măn katơơk galơh, laay kơn be lưp nhim ook kajoq, xôq ka adro heq dơơp varơuq nưq hnoq ik biq ka'lăk vlôh klơlh đom katul oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Vii gô, ju xangưưy đom xăk xamơk bơh hloay e đom danưng kooy, heq xưh xadrah adro lôp kadrôôp dang anưq yôôch, đaji laa đong e mot kađnư. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Đom yal Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, tuôôy oh ay heq jah nhomq anguk hlê, kung danưng kooy ku gô, dii taay yaak ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />xôq pahnăp adro nưq ka Sa-tan xôq chiuq varơuq păk kaxêêt xăk xamơk, aleq ka phool hiel adro nưq hnoq ik jah wơơt đom hngơy ku Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Varơuq pa ưưt akhwoak ku oh ay be tolh kaxay kajoq. Oh ay leh xet đaneq muuyq takiêh tape dơơp vôô dêq ka kuk bôôt ih? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Dayh pa xarêh tape duut, xôq oh ay hnoq ik laa kuk bôôt đơơu, dang đaji oh ay laa tôôp leh tape. Vii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, laa trưưu koot Lêh Dalơh Hlê ku haay, kung heq biq păk kaxêêt dơơp kuah lêh. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Lunưq, haay duh jưq lêh, leh aalq dii tape duut, kung be aalq dii tape pa ôôh lar ji xơk tauq, bơh laa dii tôôp leh tape ku varơuq dong dik ji varơuq dik.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Đom thư gô heq valơk ka oh ay laa te xa agưt dii bing apuq atrăp — <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />long anưq leh aalq khơl adro apuq trăp ku dêh araak neq, long laa khơl adro hmưch trôôch ji aluut pa ôôh, long khơl adro akuh vangưl, vii đanưq, oh ay duh pheq hooy vlôh klơlh dêh araak. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Bơh đaji juneq, gô heq valơk ka oh ay te xa agưt dii paq kê adro leq jah taayh laa oh ay đơu laa adro apuq atrăp, hmưch trôôch, akuh vangưl, ragơy karoay toah, vuul weel, long pa ôôh aluut; pheq đnooy kung te xa achung dii muuyq adro đanưq. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Vii xưh xadrah khơl adro măn pi gôk tapiq kajoq truh gô? Oh ay leh xưh xadrah khơl adro măn pi 'lăp ih? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk hnoq xưh xadrah khơl adro pi gôk hơq.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 5:13">“Dayh dơyh ka'lăk varơuq xơk tauq klơlh katul đom oh ay.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Tuôôy e varơuq tachơơl hlê dii adro kadrơy, kơyq nưq đom oh ay hôôk xôq biq xưh xadrah kangưưr khơl adro leh hyioh jăk, đơu leh aalq kangưưr khơl vah ih? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Long oh ay leh xet đaneq khơl vah hnoq xưh xadrah dêh araak? Ji atoh dêh araak hnoq biq xưh xadrah bơyh oh ay, yôôych oh ay leh đu paraat truh kaluh varơuq kienq thier ra de neq ih? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Oh ay leh xet đaneq haay hnoq xưh xadrah khơl yaak plêêk ih? Đnooy kajoq truh kaluh varơuq ku đơơy neq? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Anưq yôôych, ju oh ay e kaluh varơuq kienq thuôk ku đơơy neq, dơơp aleq oh ay xôq khơl adro nưq 'ngôôy xưh xadrah, 'ngưq laa khơl adro biq 'yo be e phon kajoq đom tayuup vah? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Gô đong đnooy truh varơuq thier kamưưl ier ku oh ay. Đanưq, dang aleq leh e adro khôôt xet leq đom oh ay, laa adro hnoq ik 'yo xadrah đom katul oh ay haay ih? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Wih hlê, oh ay neq chiuq palo vlôh xưh xadrah tachơơl hlê oh ay hơq, ji ka varơuq nưq măn kangưưr khơl adro be tuôq? <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Lunưq, ka varơuq neq 'miêh laa leh jay dêq hloay đôôyq dii oh ay yôôch, vii oh ay e kaluh varơuq rôp kienq đom katul kadih oh ay. Vii aleq be tha chiuq thiet? Vii aleq be tha chiuq aluut pa ôôh? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Lunư, oh ay dưk dơơp leh hyioh jăk ji aluut, yôôch dơơp anưq dii oh ay haay! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Long oh ay leh xet đaneq adro leh hyioh jăk hnoq be jah nhonq daak dêh Kơy Plêêk? Te xôq biq pa ôôh lar; be adro apuq atrăp, adro akuh vangưl, adro tuut taak, adro xakwoah, adro khơl kanau xok khơl kanau khơl drê xok khơl drê, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />adro xa atôk, adro ham hmưch, adro vuul weel, adro pahnhiq long adro aluut pa ôôh, hnoq nhonq jah daak dêh Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Ji muuyq sôôq đom oh ay heq hmưq đanưq. Lunư, oh ay heq jah pa xarêh, heq jah tađôôy đơơu, heq jah xưng hyioh jăk đom yal Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk haay.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />“Tôôy varơuq đôôyq dii gô laa ik pheep,” bơh leh aalq tôôy varơuq taway truh e ich. “Tôôy varơuq đôôyq dii gô laa ik pheep,” bơh gô hnoq leh biq dơơp xapok bơyh paq kê varơuq kajoq. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />“Tuôông xa deng ka vaduk, ji vaduk deng ka tuôông xa,” bơh Kơy Plêêk hnoq pahyaak ka'lăk hloay ưng neq hloay ưng hơq. Bơh xăk xamơk leh aalq deng ka varơuq apuq atrăp, đơu deng ka Lôôk, ji Lôôk deng ka xăk xamơk. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Kơy Plêêk heq khienq Lôôk riirh hlê, kung hnoq khienq haay riirh hlê bơyh taay yaak ku Kadraq. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Oh ay leh xet đaneq xăk xamơk haay laa chi thêêh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ih? Anưq yôôych, atêq tuôôy xok chi thêêh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, gô duh dơơp ni jêêk chi thêêh ku adro xakwoah be? Leh dong leq e varơuq nưq! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Long oh ay leh xet đaneq adro tabich kadih ni dii adro xakwoah laa muuyq hlek dii ni? Vii e valơk: “Vaarq adro hnoq jêêk vlôh muuyq hlek.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Bơh kơyq tabich kadih ni dii Lôôk yôôych laa muuyq danưng kooy kung Kadraq. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Dayh chuh xangưưy varơuq apuq atrăp! Tôôy kadrôôp đơu khơl kadrơy lôp e be laa măn pi gôk xăk xamơk, bơh adro dơơp varơuq apuq atrăp yôôych lôp kadrôôp dii kadih xăk xamơk ni. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Long oh ay leh xet đaneq xăk xamơk oh ay laa hnhư hơu ku Kơy Phool Hiel măn đom oh ay, laa Kơy đơu oh ay nhonq xing Kơy Plêêk? Ji oh ay be thuôk xuq kadih oh ay, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />vii oh ay heq jah root bla bơơn jaq kanaq yôôch. Vii anưq, dayh dơơp tađnah tađnaak Kơy Plêêk bơơn xăk xamơk oh ay.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Măn truh kaluh varơuq đơu oh ay heq valơk: “Dik tolh ka khơl kanau leh achung tapiq dii khơl drê.” <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Bơh vii adô aluut apuq atrăp, tôôy adro khơl kanau dayh xok kadrê ka xăk, ji tôôy khơl drê dayh xok kanau ka xăk. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Kanau pheq dơơp xaleep trek nhiimq đôôyq dii kadrê, măn kadrê đôôyq dii kanau kung dang đanưq. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Kadrê leh e qwuyen tol xăk xamơk ku ni, bơh laa kanau. Đơu dang đanưq, kanau kung leh e qwuyen tol xăk xamơk ku ni, bơh laa kadrê. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Te chôôyq ka'lăk mamuuyq, đêh vlôh laa bơyh varơuq muuyq xuum đom muuyq kawat heq đinq xôq oh ay hnoq ik wêêt xuum apôôy, yôôch laay măn kung mamuuyq, xôq ka Sa-tan be hnoq ik adô aluut oh ay bơyh varơuq thiuq jư xăk ku oh ay.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Lunư, gô đnooy varơuq neq đaji muuyq varơuq ăm pheep, leh aalq đaji apok tanưưl. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Bơh gô trôôch kajoq tôôy adro pheq đnooy ik đaji gô. Long anưq, tôôy adro e vanong đêh xing Kơy Plêêk, long e adro luneq, bơh e adro luhơq. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Măn đôôyq dii khơl adro koq lưp pajêêk ji khơl valơu, gô đnooy đaneq atoh oot kưq ratuut đaji gô laa tolh. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Bơh atoh oot leh jư xăk ik, yôôych oot dayh pajêêk. Vii pajêêk yôôych tolh iaq chiuq hluul vuh. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Măn đôôyq dii khơl adro heq pajêêk yôôych gô đnooy dăt — leh aalq gô, đơu laa Lôôk — đaneq kadrê leh ik ka'lăk klơlh kanau <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />(bơh pheq đnooy atoh mư nưq heq biq ka'lăk, yôôych mư pheq kưq ratuut leh pajêêk đnoyq, long pheq dơơp tagu hlê dii kanau), ji kanau yôôych leh ik ka'lăk kadrê. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Bơh đôôyq dii khơl adro măn hlê yôôych gô đnooy — gô, nưq lưp aalq Lôôk — atoh oh ay leq e kadrê koq tuôq, ji mư nưq chiuq xuum riirh dii oh ay, yôôych oh ay leh ik pheep ka'lăk mư nưq. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Atoh muuyq mư kadrê leq e kanau koq tuôq ji adro nưq chiuq xuum riirh dii mư, yôôych kadrê leh ik ka'lăk kanau. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Vii kanau koq tuôq jah tađôôy đơơu gamưh kadrê ni, ji kadrê koq tuôq jah tađôôy đơơu gamưh adro oh ay nưq. Vii atoh leh yôôych koot xau oh ay laa leh paxa rêh, bơh juneq oot jah vah. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Măn atoh adro leh tuôq nưq aklah vlôh kadih, yôôych dayh xôq adro nưq jah aklah vlôh. Adro oh ay long mư nưq leh biq vek jư đom ka varơuq nưq, đơu laa Kơy Plêêk heq tawooyh taayh haay măn đom varơuq hrok hrol. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Vii, wơơy adro mư, dơơp aleq mư xet e be đaneq mư hnoq wơơt ik kanau mư? Long, wơơy adro oh ay, dơơp aleq oh ay xet e be đaneq oh ay hnoq wơơt ik kadrê oh ay? <verse eid="1CO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Atoh lưp e, yôôych Lôôk heq aklah ahlook ka tưng adro vlôh ih, Kơy Plêêk heq tawooyh taayh tôôy adro đaleq, dayh tawaak hooy đanưq. Ji gô duh đinq đanưq đom dêq hloay kaluh tayuup vah. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Kơyq heq jah taayh atêq tuôôy chiuq goch kađuh be? Adro nưq te đaji koq goch kađuh. Kơyq heq jah taayh đom ka varơuq koq goch kađuh be? Adro nưq te chiuq goch kađuh. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Goch kađuh be laa kajoq, leh goch kađuh kung be laa kajoq, đơu duh dik laa varơuq tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Tôôy adro, đom apok taayh đơu haay heq jah tawooyh taayh, dayh kưq ratuut đnoyq đom varơuq taayh nưq. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Oh ay heq jah tawooyh taayh đom varơuq dơơp xapok be? Te xôq varơuq nưq dơơp ka oh ay biit ravơq. Lunư, atoh oh ay dik hnoq ik jêêk vlôh rayơh rayơơy, yôôych dayh rôp xok kawah. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Vii muuyq adro, laa xapok, jah tawooyh taayh đom Lôôk yôôych jêêk vlôh manih rayơh rayơơy ku Lôôk. Kung anưq, manih rayơh rayơơy jah tawooyh taayh yôôych jêêk vlôh xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Oh ay heq jah root bla bơơn jaq kanaq yôôch; te jêêk vlôh xapok ku koot manih. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Wơơy oh ay, tôôy adro măn đom ka varơuq leq tuôôy jah tawooyh taayh, yôôych dayh kưq ratuut đnoyq dii Kơy Plêêk đom ka varơuq nưq.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Bơh apiq truh khơl adro măn valơu, gô leh e apok tanưưl ku Lôôk. Lunư, gô đnooy vlôh ka iq vii heq nhonq jah vanong biit angơuq xing Lôôk xôq laa muuyq adro đangq tuôq gamưh. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Jo nưq, gô ăm đaneq ka varơuq nưq laa tolh, vii kơq varơuq pơơl hwơơl heq truh jeq, đaneq dik tolh ka muuyq adro ratuut đnoyq măn đom ka varơuq đanưq. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Jơq be oh ay jah vek jư dii kadrê? Te axek trôôk xaloot ka'lăk. Jơq be oh ay jah xaloot ka'lăk klơlh kadrê? Te axek kadrê. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Măn atoh oh ay pajêêk kadrê, yôôych oh ay leh lôp kadrôôp; ji atoh muuyq khơl drê tadăp xok kanau, yôôych mư nưq leh lôp kadrôôp. Lunư, khơl adro đanưq hnoq e varơuq pơơl hwơơl đom xăk xamơk, đơu gô trôôch oh ay chuh klơlh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Bơh, wơơy oh ay, gô đnooy varơuq neq: Kawat yôôych paq măn 'ngưng, xôq ka xing neng truh atêq, dêq hloay khơl adro e kadrê yôôych dang đaji leh e; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />khơl leq nhim, yôôych đaji leh nhim; kơyq hlah hlaak, yôôych đaji be hlah; khơl leq root xôq, yôôych đaji be lưp e kajoq; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />ji khơl leq jung garuh anôôp dêh araak, yôôych đaji leh xok dơơp; vii ka varơuq ku dêh araak neq đong dalơh hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Panưh kadrơy, gô trôôch xung oh ay jah klơlh lo biit. Adro măn valơu tabông truh kaluh varơuq thuôk xuq Lôôk, trôôk leq đơu ni hnoq ik dơơp hlah xuum Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Bơh khơl kanau heq pajêêk tabông truh kaluh varơuq ku đơơy neq, trôôk leq adro kanau hnoq ik dơơp hlah xuum kadrê ni, ji adro nưq biq ravơq xuum. Khơl drê măn valơu long măn tadăp <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />tabông truh kaluh varơuq thuôk xuq Lôôk, dơơp aleq ka ni hnoq ik jah vah xarêh kaah đom xăk xamơk hloay đom danưng kooy. Bơh khơl drê heq pajêêk tabông truh kaluh varơuq ku đơơy neq, trôôk leq adro kadrê hnoq ik dơơp hlah xuum kanau ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Lunư, gô đong đnooy varơuq neq vii e ich ku kadih oh ay, leh aalq xôq gô hnoq ik xôq rayuulh rôp băt oh ay, bơh xôq wih truh varơuq hơu varơuq dong tamuut ji garơng xuum ka Lôôk muuyq kach leh biit ravơq. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Bơh atoh adro leq 'yo đaneq đong xa dơơp leh jơq đôôyq dii oh kadrê tadăp ku ni — jơq be oh kadrê hnoq ik biq ngwook ji vii anưq varơuq pajêêk duh ik xalih vlôh — yôôych adro nưq dayh dơơp varơuq ni xung trôôch. Adro nưq be lôp kadrôôp; dayh xôq oot pajêêk. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Măn kơyq jư kajưk đom xuum ni, be e varơuq ahluk ahnen, đơu e qwuyen tol iq trôôch ku kadih ni ji adro nưq heq đinq đanưq đom xuum ni — xôq 'yo jư koot kadrê tadăp ku ni — yôôych adro nưq hnoq dưk dơơp kach troq jơq. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Đanưq, adro ga koot kadrê tadăp ni dơơp jơq, ji adro leh ga pheq đnooy hnoq dơơp tolh iaq. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Adro kadrê biq vek jư tuôôt chưng leq kanau ni măn riirh. Bơh atoh kanau kaxêêt, yôôych mư nưq jah rayơh rayơơy pajêêk dii adro leq ni trôôch, pheq laa đom Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Lunư, tyauq iq đnooy ku gô yôôych mư nưq jah vanong iaq atoh hnoq ik ratuôôt đnoyq măn đanưq. Bơh, gô biit đaneq gô kung e Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Truh kaluh thưq đơơp ka vangưl: Haay xet đaneq dêq hloay haay e hlolh xet. Hlolh xet yôôych khienq katơơk galơh, bơh xuum xung xiaq yôôych rôôk đơ. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Atoh kơyq biit ni xet varơuq kajoq nưq, yôôych adro nưq măn koq xet đaji ni duh xet. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Bơh atoh kơyq vado xiaq Kơy Plêêk, yôôych adro nưq jah Kadraq nhonq xet. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Anưq, truh varơuq xa kaluh thưq đơơp đok ka vangưl: Haay xet đaneq vangưl đom dêh araak laa leh e dik, ji đaneq be e yaak vah leq đêh vlôh Kơy Plêêk vơ muuyq. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Vii hloay kaah atoh e kaluh thưq jah taayh laa yaak, long măn tol plêêk long 'laarq vari, dang đaji e 'ngưng “yaak” ji 'ngưng “lôôk”, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />bơh đôôyq dii haay vơ e muuyq Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, Kơy đơu tôôy paroh đơơu e, ji laa Kơy đơu haay wih xuq, kung muuyq Lôôk laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, gamưh Kadraq đơu tôôy paroh jah panưk jêêk, ji gamưh Kadraq đơu haay jah e mot.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Lunưq, hlolh xet neq leh măn đom tôôy adro. Bơh 'ngưng adro nưq tyauq katik xing adroyq truh juneq dii vangưl, oot xa kaluh thưq nưq đaji laa tuôông heq đơơp ka vangưl, yôôch xuum klaak 'miêh ravoch ku oot biq klơơr 'yêq. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Panưh kadrơy, tuôông xa hnoq be taway haay truh jeq Kơy Plêêk; atoh leh xa, haay kung be axit hlê, atoh xa haay kung be athêêp iaq. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Bơh dayh rơơt rol, leh kheoq bơơn kach leq nưq, qwuyen rayơh rayơơy neq ku oh ay hnoq ik jêêk vlôh kơq xatôôlh lôp ka adro ravoch. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Vii atoh kơyq nưq 'yo hloq adro e hlolh xet 'ngôôy xa đom hnhư akuh vangưl, yôôych be aalq xuum klaak 'miêh ravoch ku oot hnoq biq ahluk ahlul xôq xa kaluh thưq jah đơơp ka vangưl ih? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Nưq yôôych, muuyq adro ravoch, muuyq adro oh ay đơu Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt thay, biq hư hlơơp bơyh hlolh xet ku oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Panưh kadrơy, tyauq kach nưq, tuôôy lôp kadrôôp tachơơl hlê dii khơl oh ay haay ji dơơp jiq xuum xuum klaak ravoch ku oot, yôôych oh ay lôp kadrôôp tachơơl hlê dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Lunưq atoh tuôông xa dơơp ka muuyq adro oh ay ku gô lôp kadrôôp, yôôych gô kajưk dik hnoq leh 'leq xa ôq, xôq ka gô be dơơp xatôôlh lôp ka adro oh ay ku gô.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Gô leh jah rayơh rayơơy ih? Gô leh aalq laa muuyq adro jah rơơlh ih? Gô koq hmưq tavơh Lôôk Jê-xu, Lôôk haay ih? Be aalq oh ay laa varơuq dơơp ku gô đom Lôôk ih? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ju gô leh aalq laa adro jah rơơlh đôôyq dii khơl adro kadrơy, bơh axit dik gô laa adro jah rơơlh đôôyq dii oh ay. Vii oh ay laa bơơn xanưk truh varơuq dơơp adro jah rơơlh ku gô đom Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Apok tagêh hlê ku gô đôôyq dii khơl adro vôôch 'yo gô laa luneq: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Be aleq 'wot leh e qwuyen xa ji hôôch? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Be aleq 'wot leh e qwuyen jarooy tyauq muuyq adro kadrê tuôq Lôôk, kung đaji khơl jah rơơlh kadrơy kung khơl adro ma oh kanau ku Lôôk ji Sê-pha? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Long vơ muuyq Ba-na-ba ji gô be e qwuyen leh dơơp varơuq? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Kơyq hooy kuun bơơn jêêt hnhư ni dong leq? Kơyq pêêt hluôôt nho đơu leh xa play ni? Long kơyq xakaq bơy đơu leh hôôch sưah ku bơy? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Leh aalq gô đong đnooy kaluh varơuq neq tyauq kach manih đơơy ih, long ganuun kung be đnooy kaluh varơuq nưq? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Vii e apok valơk đom ganuun Môi-se: “Te trôôp ro muut moong ôô bo đong joaq va.” Be aleq Kơy Plêêk lo ka ôô bo? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Long Kadraq xanoh dêq hloay vii ich lơơy ku haay? Dik, apok jah valơk vii ich lơơy ku haay, đaneq adro akay ruôngq pheq akay đom takôô gamưh, ji manih joaq va yôôych dơơp đom varơuq xuum takôô truh phon ahlook ka ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Atoh 'wot heq paraay kaluh varơuq danưng kooy đom katul oh ay, yôôych e lưp qwaq be atoh 'wot hnoq goch xok kaluh vâk xăk xamơk xing oh ay? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Atoh Khơl adro kadrơy e phon truh qwuyen nưq tol oh ay, yôôych be aalq 'wot kang 'ngưng iaq ih? Lunư, 'wot leh xok dơơp qwuyen neq. Tađôôy muut đnư, 'wot chiuq uunq tôôy varơuq xôq 'wot leh taway truh paq kê klơl đơ leq ka Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Oh ay leh xet đaneq khơl leq hơu varơuq đom hnhư hơu yôôych xa kaluh thưq ku hnhư hơu, khơl adro hơu varơuq aduq para hơu yôôych e phon aduq para hơu, long ih? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Kung muuyq kach nưq, Lôôk heq đnooy pato đaneq khơl adro đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay yôôych riirh gamưh Hêêl Kaxay. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Bơh gô be xok dơơp paq kê varơuq leq đom kaluh qwuyen nưq. Panưh kadrơy, gô leh valơk kaluh apok neq xôq qwuyen nưq jah xôq dơơp ka gô đanưq, vii đôôyq dii gô, tha kaxêêt măn iaq laa paq kê kơyq hnoq dơơp ka xuum tađnah mot ku gô vlôh hư hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Bơyh atoh gô padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay, yôôych be e kajoq ka gô xôq pa ưưt xăk, jo ka varơuq băt dăt jah pahnăp xôq tol gô. Vii dik laa ra ơơh ka gô atoh gô leh padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Atoh gô hlah xuum dơơp varơuq nưq, yôôych gô jah phon kadrool. Măn atoh leh hlah xuum, yôôych gô heq chiuq pahnăp ăm varơuq dơơp manih xakaq 'yo yôôch. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Anưq, phon kadrool ku gô laa kajoq? Nưq laa tuôôy padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay leh duh baak jêêt, gô hnoq ik padoh pato Hêêl Kaxay dơơp aleq ka leh xok dơơp qwuyen ku gô đom Hêêl Kaxay. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Vii ju jah rayơh rayơơy klơlh tôôy varơuq, gô heq khienq kadih xăk dơơp xapok ka tôôy adro, xôq gô hnoq ik jah xuum 'ngưng adro iaq. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Đôôyq dii manih Jo Thaiq, gô jêêk vlôh đaji manih Jo Thaiq, xôq gô hnoq ik jah xuum manih Jo Thaiq. Đôôyq dii khơl adro măn 'laarq ganuun, gô jêêk vlôh đaji adro măn 'laarq ganuun, ju kadih gô leh măn 'laarq ganuun, xôq gô hnoq ik jah xuum khơl adro măn 'laarq ganuun. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Đôôyq dii khơl adro leh e ganuun, gô jêêk vlôh đaji adro leh e ganuun (ju be aalq laa leh e ganuun ku Kơy Plêêk, bơh laa măn 'laarq ganuun ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh), xôq gô hnoq ik jah xuum khơl adro leh e ganuun. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Đôôyq dii khơl adro ravoch, gô jêêk vlôh ravoch, xôq gô hnoq ik jah xuum khơl adro ravoch. Gô heq jêêk vlôh tôôy kach đôôyq dii tôôy adro, xôq ka gô hnoq ik bơơn tôôy kach wơơt jah muuyq sôôq adro. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Panưh kadrơy, gô dơơp tôôy varơuq vii kơq Hêêl Kaxay, xôq gô hnoq ik jêêk vlôh adro jưq phon đom nưq. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Oh ay leh xet đaneq dêq hloay khơl manih charơơk đom aduq charơơk tathi raay charơơk, bơh vơ muuyq adro nhonq jah kadrool ih? Dayh charơơk tyauq kach nưq xôq oh ay hnoq ik jah ik phon kadrool. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Panưh kadrơy, tôôy adro tagoa charơơk đom kaluh đơơt tathi yôôych atuq varơuq katik jư xăk đom tôôy varơuq. Long oot chiuq anưq xôq oot hnoq ik nhonq đoat tađnah dayh hư hlơơp, bơh haay laa đoat tađnah leh hư hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Vii anưq, gô charơơk đanưq, be aalq đaji leh e muk đik; gô hmơt thuk đanưq, be aalq đaji hmơt không khiq. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Wih hlê, gô rôp băt xăk xamơk gô ji dơơp ni vlôh xapok, leh kheoq bơơn kach leq nưq, atêq tuôôy pato dayq 'ngưng adro kadrơy, kadih xăk gô hnoq ik biq ka'lăk vlôh.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Vii wơơy oh ay, gô be trôôch oh ay leh xet đaneq mo kơy haay dêq hloay heq măn 'laarq đum kluk, dêq hloay heq hooy dalơh tahli, <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />dêq hloay wih tyauq Môi-se heq jah dơơp bap-tem đom đum kluk ji 'laarq tahli, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />dêq hloay heq xa kung muuyq tuôông xa danưng kooy, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />ji dêq hloay heq hôôch kung muuyq tuôông hôôch danưng kooy, vii oot hôôch xing muuyq look phơu danưng kooy tyauq oot, đơu phơu nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Lunư, Kơy Plêêk heq leh kaxay xuum dii 'ngưng sôôq khơl adro nưq, lunưq oot heq biq gưlh riêp kađnư đom wăngq we. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Panưh kadrơy, kaluh varơuq neq heq jêêk vlôh kaluh atoh ka haay, xôq be khienq haay laa khơl adro hmưch trôôch kaluh varơuq xơk tauq kung dang đaji oot heq hmưch trôôch. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kung te jêêk vlôh khơl adro akuh vangưl đaji taleq adro hơq đom sôôq oot; pheq đnooy đaji e apok valơk: “Manih karôp 'ngôôy pôôt xôq xa ji hôôch, yôôch dưk tok agưt ahrơh.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Haay kung te liq lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp đaji 'ngưng adro đom sôôq oot heq dơơp atrăp, đơu vaarq kưl pe ravơu manih heq gưlh kaxêêt đom muuyq hngơy. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Kung te liq thưh Lôôk đaji 'ngưng adro đom sôôq oot heq thưh Kadraq yôôch biq păk kaxêêt bơyh volh. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kung te ramôôy đaji 'ngưng adro đom sôôq oot heq ramôôy ji biq kơy păk kaxêêt hlơơp păk kaxêêt. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Lunư, kaluh varơuq nưq heq xalih vlôh ka oot đaji kaluh atoh, đơu kaluh nưq heq jah valơk hlê deng ka varơuq đnooy pato ka haay, laa tol khơl adro đơu kaluh varơuq lôôch dik ku kaluh đơơy xanưm heq truh yôôch. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Vii anưq, kơyq biit ni dưk, dayh rơơt rol kheoq gưlh. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Be varơuq adô aluut leq heq truh kung oh ay đêh vlôh varơuq thuôk xuq koot manih; panưh kadrơy, Kơy Plêêk jư apok, laa Kơy hnoq leh xôq oh ay biq adô aluut galơh iaq paraat oh ay hnoq ik, bơh dii varơuq adô aluut nưq, Kadraq kung hnoq dơơp vlôh trôôk xaloot xôq oh ay hnoq chiuq uunq ik.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Vii anưq, oh ay xung xiaq ku gô lơơy, dayh chuh xangưưy klơlh varơuq akuh vangưl. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Đaji laa gô đong đnooy padoh dii khơl adro khôôt xet. Oh ay dayh kadih 'yo hlê varơuq gô đnooy. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Dooy vanong kaxay đơu haay kuh kway, be aalq nưq laa varơuq jưq phon đom vahaap ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ih? Tôôp đơu haay pleh vlôh, be aalq nưq laa varơuq jưq phon đom xăk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ih? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Vii e muuyq poop tôôp, lunưq haay, ju 'ngưng, vơ laa muuyq xăk, vii dêq hloay haay jưq phon đom muuyq poop tôôp. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Dayh 'yo manih I-sơ-ra-ên tyauq phon xăk. Be aalq khơl leq xa kuah tưp laa khơl adro jưq phon aduq para hơu ih? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Anưq, gô đong đnooy varơuq kajoq? Kuah đơơp vangưl laa thưq kajoq, long vangưl laa kajoq? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ju anưq, kaluh thưq đơu khơl tamooy kadrơy đơơp tưp laa đơơp tưp ka kamuuych, leh aalq ka Kơy Plêêk. Đơu gô leh trôôch oh ay jêêk vlôh khơl adro jưq phon dii kaluh kamuuych! <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Oh ay be hnoq ik hôôch dooy ku Lôôk ji dooy ku kamuuych ik. Oh ay be hnoq ik jưq phon aduq para ku Lôôk ji aduq para ku kamuuych ik. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Long haay trôôch tache ka Lôôk tôq jaraq be? Be aleq haay yôôych kalh iaq Kadraq?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Tôôy varơuq yôôych ik pheep,” bơh leh aalq tôôy varơuq taway truh ich lơơy. “Tôôy varơuq yôôych ik pheep,” bơh leh aalq tôôy varơuq xagook truh varơuq rôôk đơ. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Te kơyq axek akhiim ich lơơy ku đêh xăk, bơh laa ich lơơy ku khơl kadrơy. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Dayh xa tôôy thưq jah tabôôt tek aduq tabôôt tek, leh tawaq kajoq vii kơq xuum klaak. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Vii “vari kung tôôy thưq đom ni thuôk xuq Lôôk.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Atoh paq kê adro koq tuôq leq mơơy oh ay ji oh ay trôôch hooy, yôôych dayh xa tôôy tuôông jah doot kangưưr oh ay, leh tawaq varơuq kajoq vii kơq xuum klaak. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Bơh atoh kơyq nưq đnooy dii oh ay: “Neq laa đô đơơp,” yôôych te xa, vii kơq adro nưq, laa adro heq ăm oh ay xet, ji xuum klaak — <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />bơh gô đnooy truh xuum klaak, leh aalq laa ku xăk xamơk oh ay, đơu laa xuum klaak ku adro nưq. Nưq laa vii aleq varơuq rayơh rayơơy ku gô biq xuum klaak ku khơl kadrơy xưh xadrah? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Atoh gô achung jưq dii xuum xet ơơn, yôôych aleq gô biq đnooy ra ơơh vii tuôông đơu gô kuh kway? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Jo nưq, paq kê oh ay xa long hôôch, long dơơp muuyq varơuq leq nưq, dayh dơơp dêq hloay ka varơuq tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Te dơơp kơq lôp kadrôôp ka dêq manih Jo Thaiq hloay ka manih Hi Lap ji tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />dang đaji gô kung hlah xuum hơu varơuq tôôy adro đom tôôy varơuq, leh axek lơơy ich ku đêh gô, bơh laa lơơy ich ku 'ngưng adro, xôq oot hnoq ik jah wơơt.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Dayh jêêk vlôh khơl adro dơơp atôôlh gô, đaji gô kung laa adro dơơp atôôlh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Gô vado oh ay vii oh ay heq văch truh gô đom tôôy varơuq, ji oh ay jư kajưk kaluh apok hnu, dang đaji gô heq pato ka oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Lunư, gô trôôch oh ay hlolh đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa akoq ku tôôy adro khơl kanau, đơu khơl kanau laa akoq ku khơl drê, măn Kơy Plêêk laa akoq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Tôôy adro khơl kanau apôôy long đnooy hlit, atoh e kajoq nưq klum tol akoq, yôôych dơơp kamưưl akoq ni. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Bơh tôôy adro khơl drê apôôy long đnooy hlit dii akoq leh jah klum hlê, yôôych dơơp kamưưl akoq ni. Vii varơuq neq laa muuyq dii varơuq akoq heq biq kwoah. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Vii atoh muuyq khơl drê leh klum akoq, yôôych mư nưq kung dayh goch hlôôk dơyh. Măn atoh goch hlôôk long kwoah akoq laa varơuq kamưưl dik đôôyq dii khơl drê, yôôych mư nưq pheq klum akoq hlê. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Bơyh muuyq panưh, khơl kanau be duh klum akoq oot vii laa long lơuq ji tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk. Panưh kadrơy, khơl drê laa tađnah tađnaak ku khơl kanau. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Vii khơl kanau yôôych be vlôh xing khơl drê, đơu laa khơl drê vlôh xing khơl kanau. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Kung vii khơl kanau leh jah panưh jêêk vii khơl drê, đơu laa khơl drê vii khơl kanau. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Vii kakơq nưq, khơl drê duh pheq ayil dơuq hlêêl da uh qwuyen tol akoq oot, vii kơq khơl yaak plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ju anưq, đom Lôôk, khơl drê leh đê đêh dii khơl kanau, khơl kanau kung be đê đêh dii khơl drê. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Vii khơl drê vlôh xing khơl kanau đaleq, yôôych khơl kanau kung gamưh khơl drê đơu e đanưq, bơh tôôy paroh vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Dayh 'yo hlê măn katul kadih khơl oh ay: Adro Khơl drê leh klum akoq apôôy dii Kơy Plêêk yôôych e tamuut be? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Be aalq hloay kaah kadih varơuq tưq nhiên pato oh ay đaneq muuyq panưh, atoh khơl kanau xôq hlôôk yơơt, yôôych nưq laa varơuq kamưưl dik ka ni, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />panưh kadrơy, atoh khơl drê e hlôôk yơơt, yôôych nưq laa tađnah tađnaak deng ka mư nưq ih? Vii hlôôk yơơt heq jah kahniq ka mư nưq dang đaji khanh klum akoq. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Măn atoh kơyq đong đaji e xuum takaay tayaat truh varơuq neq, yôôych 'wot leh e kiêuh katik đanưq, kaluh tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk kung lưp.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Bơh tuôôy đnooy vlôh apok tanưưl neq, gô be vado oh ay, vii oh ay anguk tagumq dii mamuuyq leh jarooy truh varơuq tolh iaq bơh laa wih truh aduq têq iaq. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Vii adroyq dik, tuôôy oh ay anguk hlê đom tayuup vah, gô tameng truh 'ngưng varơuq aklah vlôh măn đom katul oh ay, ji gô tuôq varơuq nưq phon leq. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Vii duh pheq e kaluh bing ja đom katul oh ay, xôq ka khơl leq heq chiuq thưh kung hnoq ik kahnoq vlôh ro raang đom katul oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Vii anưq, tuôôy oh ay anguk hlê aduq kung muuyq duq, varơuq nưq be aalq laa xôq jưq Waal Vah ku Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Vii đom tuôôy xa, tôôy adro lo xa waal xa ku ni adroyq; lunưq long e adro yôôych pangoot hrah, bơh e adro yôôych vuul weel. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Be aleq oh ay leh e hnhư xôq xa ji hôôch đom nưq ih? Long oh ay 'yo leh ra kajoq tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk ji dơơp kamưưl mot khơl adro be e kajoq? Gô duh đnooy kajoq dii oh ay? Duh vado oh ay truh varơuq neq be? Gô be vado oh ay 'leq! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Vii gô heq nhonq xing Lôôk varơuq gô kung heq pato hlê ka oh ay, nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu, đom klôôy đơu Kadraq biq rôp, heq xok tôôp, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />yôôch atêq tuôôy kuh kway, Kadraq pleh ni vlôh ji đnooy: “Neq laa xăk xamơk ku thơy thay ka oh ay. Dayh dơơp varơuq neq đom varơuq biit văch truh thơy.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Kung muuyq trôôk nưq đôôyq dii dooy atêq tuôôy xa, đaneq: “Dooy neq laa apok tavek đơơu đom vahaap thơy. Long tuôôy leq oh ay hôôch dooy, dayh dơơp varơuq neq đom varơuq biit văch truh thơy.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Vii atoh tuôôy leq oh ay xa tôôp neq ji hôôch dooy neq, yôôych oh ay đnooy vlôh varơuq kaxêêt ku Lôôk dong truh tuôôy Kadraq truh. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Lunưq, paq kê kơyq xa tôôp long hôôch dooy ku Lôôk muuyq kach leh taxưngq yôôych hnoq e kadrôôp dii xăk ji vahaap ku Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Wih hlê, tôôy adro pheq kadih 'yo hlê xăk, yôôch đom varơuq nưq dayh xa tôôp ji hôôch dooy. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Vii adro xa ji hôôch đơu leh kahra xăk Lôôk laa xa ji hôôch varơuq xưh xadrah ka xăk. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Vii kakơq nưq, 'ngưng adro đom oh ay jiq jiêh, bingq tâk ji 'ngưng adro vik. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Bơh atoh haay kadih 'yo hlê xăk, yôôych dik haay leh biq xưh xadrah. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Măn tuôôy biq Lôôk xưh xadrah, haay biq 'meq dook xôq klơlh biq xưh xadrah achung dii dêh araak. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Lunưq, oh ay ku gô lơơy, tuôôy anguk hlê xôq xa, dayh takôô mamuuyq. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Atoh adro leq pangoot, yôôych dayh xa ma hnhư, xôq oh ay leh anguk tagumq măn đom varơuq xưh xadrah. Măn truh kaluh varơuq kadrơy, gô hnoq đnooy vlôh apok pato jarooy hloay tuôôy leq gô truh.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Măn truh kaluh vanong danưng kooy, wơơy oh ay, gô leh xung oh ay be xet kajoq. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Oh ay xet đaneq tuôôy oh ay măn laa manih koq tuôq, oh ay heq biq jarooy tyauq kach leq nưq, tuôôy biq adô aluut wih truh kaluh vangưl hôp. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Vii anưq, gô kahnoq ka oh ay xet đaneq leh kơyq đnooy vlôh bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk đơu laay đnooy: “Jê-xu laa adro đangq karoay axaap!”, ji atoh leh bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel, be kơyq hnoq ik xưng nhonq “Lôôk Jê-xu laa Lôôk.”<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Panưh kadrơy, e 'ngưng varơuq đêh raa truh kaluh vanong, bơh kung muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />E 'ngưng varơuq đêh raa truh kaluh varơuq hơu varơuq, đơu kung muuyq Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />E 'ngưng varơuq đêh raa truh kaluh varơuq dơơp, đơu kung muuyq Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy dơơp tôôy varơuq đom tôôy adro. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Bơh varơuq kahnoq vlôh ku Kơy Phool Hiel jah kahniq ka tôôy adro xôq taway hlê ich lơơy achung. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Vii gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel, apok khôôt xet jah kahniq ka adro neq, măn apok hlolh xet jah kahniq ka adro hơq tyauq kung muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel nưq; <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />bơyh kung muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel xuum tuôq jah kahniq ka adro neq, măn vanong payơh bingq jah kahniq ka adro kadrơy bơyh muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel nưq, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />yôôch ăm adro neq, kaluh varơuq dơơp taay yaak; ăm adro hơq, apok đnooy hlit; ăm adro kadrơy, e paraat kahra xet kaluh yaak; ăm adro kadrơy, kaluh kiêuh thưq apok xarooy đêh mamuuyq; đơu ăm adro kadrơy đnoyq, varơuq padoh hlolh kaluh thưq apok. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Bơh vơ muuyq heq ji kung muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel dưk dơơp tôôy varơuq nưq, tuôôy ahlook kaluh nưq kach đêh raa ka tôôy adro xatyauq iq Kadraq trôôch.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Vii dang đaji xăk laa muuyq đơu e 'ngưng chi thêêh, măn dêq hloay kaluh chi thêêh ku xăk, ju e 'ngưng, yôôych vơ laa muuyq xăk; Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung đanưq. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Vii dik bơyh muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel, dêq hloay haay jah dơơp bap-tem muut đom muuyq xăk, ju laa manih Jo Thaiq long manih Hi Lap, ju laa xapok long rayơh rayơơy, yôôych dêq hloay jah khienq ăm hôôch muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Jo xăk leh aalq laa muuyq chi thêêh, bơh laa 'ngưng chi thêêh. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Atoh jôôk đnooy: “Vii gô leh aalq laa ti, lunưq gô leh thuôk xuq xăk,” yôôych leh ik vii kơq nưq ni leh thuôk xuq xăk. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Ji atoh đaji tôôr đnooy: “Vii gô leh aalq laa mot, lunưq gô leh thuôk xuq xăk,” yôôych leh ik vii kơq nưq đơu ni leh thuôk xuq xăk. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Atoh padêq xăk laa kalook mot, yôôych varơuq tameng măn 'leq? Atoh padêq xăk laa troop tôôr, yôôych varơuq hiip măn 'leq? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Lunưq, wih hlê, Kơy Plêêk heq ralauq xôq kaluh chi thêêh đom xăk, tưng poop muuyq đom sôôq oot, xatyauq iq Kadraq trôôch. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Măn atoh dêq hloay 'miêh laa muuyq chi thêêh, yôôych xăk măn 'leq? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Đơu bơyh đanưq, long 'ngưng chi thêêh, bơh vơ muuyq xăk. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Panưh kadrơy, mot be hnoq ik đnooy dii ti: “Gô leh e varơuq duh truh ay”, long akoq kung anưq đôôyq dii jôôk: “Gô leh e varơuq duh truh ay.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Wih hlê, kaluh xăk xamơk đom xăk e veeh đaji laa pơh pơơl iaq yôôych laa varơuq duh kang iaq; <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Ưng phon leq đom xăk đơu haay hloq e veeh laa tâm thương iaq yôôych haay deng ka oot varơuq vado kôt iaq; ji kaluh chi thêêh leh kaxay ku haay yôôych e varơuq tadi rayoa 'ngưng iaq, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />măn kaluh chi thêêh heq tamaq ku haay yôôych leh e varơuq duh nưq. Lunư, Kơy Plêêk heq gariit hlê xăk dii mamuuyq, kahniq athêêp varơuq vado ka apoop leq axit jah vado, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />xôq ka leh e varơuq aklah vlôh đom xăk, bơh đơu kaluh chi thêêh kung tabông truh mamuuyq. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Atoh muuyq chi thêêh biq jiq, yôôych dêq hloay kaluh chi thêêh kung chiuq; atoh muuyq chi thêêh jah vado, yôôych tôôy chi thêêh kung hlah dii ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Panưh kadrơy, oh ay laa xăk xamơk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ji laa kaluh chi thêêh ku tưng phon đêh raa. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Kơy Plêêk heq đinq xôq muuyq sôôq adro đom tayuup vah, adroyq dik laa khơl jah rơơlh, thưq vaarq laa khơl hlit, thưq pe laa khơl thơy pato, yôôch truh kaluh pheep akêh, atêq nưq laa kaluh vanong payơh bingq, waak, dưk 'yo xakaq, ji kaluh kiêuh thưq apok xarooy đêh mamuuyq. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Be aleq dêq hloay laa khơl jah rơơlh? Be aleq dêq hloay laa khơl hlit? Be aleq dêq hloay laa thơy pato? Be aleq dêq hloay raay dơơp pheep akêh? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Be aleq dêq hloay e vanong payơh bingq? Be aleq dêq hloay đnooy apok akêh? Be aleq dêq hloay padoh hlolh ik? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Bơh dayh dêq xuum xung trôôch kaluh vanong kôt lơyq iaq. Măn hloay juneq, gô pato ka oh ay hloq muuyq poop trôôk tơơl dal iaq.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ju gô hnoq ik đnooy kaluh thưq apok ku koot manih ji yaak plêêk, đơu gô leh e xuum xung xiaq, yôôych gô heq jêêk vlôh poop chêêk ahna ahlôôk long varang khang tarok 'nhoanh. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ju gô e vanong đnooy hlit ji hnoq ik hlolh dêq hloay varơuq kadook kung tôôy hlolh xet, ji ju gô e dêq hloay xuum tuôq pheq đnooy taway ik ngok đoot, đơu gô leh e xuum xung xiaq, yôôych gô be laa kajoq dêq. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Pheq đnooy long tuôôy gô ăm dêq tôôy garuh anôôp kadih gô, ji Ju gô pahnăp xăk gô xôq ka gô hnoq ik pa ưưt vlôh, đơu gô leh e xuum xung xiaq, yôôych gô be jah kajoq. <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Xuum xung xiaq e xuum chiuq uunq ji kahnoq vlôh varơuq xuum be huq, xuum xung xiaq be tagliêh 'yarơ, xuum xung xiaq leq pa ưưt akhwoak, leh katơơk galơh, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />leh xa dơơp bơyq ba, leh axek akhiim đooy vôôch kaluh kajoq ku đêh xăk, be hlơu biq tache jaraq, leh jauq xôq varơuq xơk tauq, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />be hlah truh varơuq be hyioh jăk, bơh hlah hlaak đom varơuq dik; <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />xuum xung xiaq ragơy ka'lăk tôôy varơuq, tuôq gamưh tôôy varơuq, takôô gamưh tôôy varơuq, chiuq uunq tôôy varơuq. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Xuum xung xiaq be dong leq ruh hlơơp. Panưh kadrơy, ju laa vanong đnooy hlit, yôôych ni hnoq biq dêq; ju laa vanong đnooy 'ngưng apok, yôôych ni hnoq padơy; ju laa hlolh xet khôôt xet, yôôych ni hnoq biq ka'lăk hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Vii haay hok xet phon leq, ji haay đnooy hlit phon leq. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Bơh tuôôy varơuq xaleep truh, ưng koq xaleep ku phon nưq hnoq biq ka'lăk. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Tuôôy gô măn laa on oh, gô đnooy đaji on oh, gô 'yo biit đaji on oh, gô xa athêêk đaji on oh. Tuôôy gô heq kôt khôôt, gô ka'lăk kaluh varơuq ku on oh. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Vii tuôôy nưq, haay 'yo hloq xing ramil dii long lơuq kablo, bơh truh tuôôy nưq mot tangưưr mot. Juneq, gô e hlolh xet phon leq, bơh truh tuôôy nưq, gô hnoq nhonq xet kach xaleep, kung đaji gô heq jah nhonq xet kach xaleep. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Bơh juneq măn hlê pe varơuq neq: xuum tuôq, takôô gamưh, ji xuum xung xiaq. Đơu varơuq kôt galơh iaq dêq đom pe varơuq nưq laa xuum xung xiaq.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Dayh chawiq tyauq xuum xung xiaq, bơh pheq xung trôôch truh kaluh vanong danưng kooy, đơu nhưk laa xôq oh ay hnoq ik đnooy hlit. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Vii adro đnooy apok akêh yôôych leh đnooy dii khơl kadrơy, bơh laa dii Kơy Plêêk; vii be kơyq hlolh, long anưq, adro đnooy kaluh varơuq kadook đom danưng kooy. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Bơh adro đnooy hlit yôôych đnooy vlôh varơuq rôôk đơ, ji ahmưk nhăk kung varơuq hlơq hlôôp deng ka khơl kadrơy. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Adro đnooy apok akêh yôôych rôôk đơ kadih xăk, măn adro đnooy hlit yôôych rôôk đơ Tayuup Vah. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Panưh kadrơy, gô trôôch kajoq dêq hloay oh ay đnooy apok akêh, đơu măn iaq anưq đnoyq, nưq laa oh ay hnoq ik đnooy hlit. Bơh adro đnooy hlit 'yo duh iaq adro đnooy apok akêh, đêh vlôh kơyq nưq hno ik padoh hlolh, xôq ka tayuup vah nhonq jah varơuq rôôk đơ. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Bơh, wơơy oh ay, atoh juneq gô truh đnooy kaluh apok akêh dii oh ay, yôôych gô hnoq waak ich kajoq ka oh ay atoh gô leh đnooy dii oh ay đom varơuq kahnoq vlôh, long hlolh xet khôôt xet, long bơơn apok hlit long apok pato dayq? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Pheq đnooy kaluh valong vô tri ahna vlôh hnưm ahlôôk — ju laa diik taliaq long varo haak — atoh tôôy thưq leh dơơp vlôh kaluh ahlôôk hnưm đêh raa, yôôych hnưm jah ahlôôk tol diik taliaq long ahlôôk jah agưt tol varo haak hnoq jah nhonq xet bơơn kach leq? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Vii atoh keeng ahna vlôh hnưm ahlôôk leh ro raang yôôych kơyq hnoq ralauq xôq ka đơơt tahmơt? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Oh ay kung dang đaji lunưq, atoh gamưh hlê huuy kapiet oh ay, oh ay leh padoh vlôh apok đnooy ro raang klêq hlolh, yôôych dơơp aleq varơuq jah đnooy vlôh hnoq ik hlolh ik? Vii oh ay vơ laa đong đnooy athêêk dii không khiq. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />E kaluh kiêuh apok athêêk đêh mamuuyq tol dêh araak, bơh dong dik laa 'ngưng qwaq pheep, ji be e apok leq laa leh e iq. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Anưq, atoh gô leh xet iq ku apok athêêk, yôôych gô hnoq laa manih daak kadrơy đôôyq dii adro đong đnooy, ji adro đong đnooy nưq hnoq laa manih daak kadrơy đôôyq dii gô. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Oh ay kung dang đanưq, vii oh ay laa khơl adro xung trôôch đom kaluh vanong danưng kooy wih truh varơuq rôôk đơ tayuup vah, lunưq dayh axek akhiim xôq ka oh ay e raah jôh. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Vii anưq, adro đnooy apok akêh dayh apôôy xôq kơyq nưq hnoq ik padoh hlolh. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Atoh gô apôôy bơơn apok akêh, yôôych danưng kooy ku gô apôôy, bơh xuum biit gô yôôych be raak play kajoq. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nưq yôôych aleq neq? Gô hnoq apôôy bơơn danưng kooy, bơh kung hnoq apôôy bơơn xuum biit. Gô hnoq kacheeu bơơn danưng kooy, bơh kung hnoq kacheeu bơơn xuum biit. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Bơơn leh, atoh oh ay ayuôôt laat bơơn danưng kooy, yôôych dơơp đaleq adro dưk muut aduq ku adro leh e vanong hnoq đnooy “Amen” đôôyq dii apok kuh kway ku oh ay, vii adro nưq be xet oh ay đong đnooy kajoq? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Vii ju đaneq oh ay tơơk tưp apok kuh kway kach tolh kaxay, bơh adro kadrơy leh jah rôôk đơ. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Gô kuh kway Kơy Plêêk đaneq gô đnooy 'ngưng apok akêh iaq dêq hloay oh ay, <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />bơh đom tayuup vah, gô tha đnooy dăp apok bơơn xuum biit gô xôq gô kung hnoq ik pato dayq khơl adro kadrơy, iaq laa kawaan apok bơơn apok akêh.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Oh ay lơơy, te jêêk vlôh on oh đom xuum biit ku oh ay. Wih hlê, pheq đaji on oh đôôyq dii varơuq xơk, bơh dayh jêêk vlôh manih khôôt xet đom akoq biit. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Đom ganuun e apok valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:21">Lôôk xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Gô hnoq đnooy dii tamooy neq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">bơyh khơl adro đnooy kaluh thưq apok kadrơy ji bơơn huuy xarooy ku khơl adro be xet;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">đơu pheq đnooy đanưq, oot kung hnoq be tameng Gô.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Jơq vii đanưq, kaluh apok akêh xôq dơơp muuyq dơuq hlêêl, leh aalq ka adro tuôq, đơu laa ka adro koq tuôq; măn đnooy hlit yôôych leh aalq ka adro koq tuôq, đơu laa ka adro tuôq. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Anưq yôôych, atoh đaji dêq tayuup vah anguk hlê măn kung muuyq aduq ji dêq hloay đnooy apok akêh, đơu adro leh e vanong long adro koq tuôq truh jưq, yôôych be aalq oot hnoq đnooy đaneq oh ay adruôy ta'ngơk ih? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Bơh atoh dêq hloay đnooy hlit, đơu muuyq sôôq adro koq tuôq long adro leh e vong truh jưq, yôôych adro nưq hnoq jah tôôy adro toah ji jah tôôy dro xưh xadrah, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />kaluh varơuq padu đom xuum adro nưq jah vlôh ro raang, ji vii anưq, tuôôy heq kul xăk pôôt, adro nưq hnoq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, đnooy vlôh đaneq “Kơy Plêêk dong dik măn katul oh ay.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Anưq, wơơy oh ay, ruut hlê laa kajoq? Tuôôy oh ay anguk tagumq hlê, tôôy adro e thi thiên, e apok pato dayq, e varơuq kahnoq vlôh, e apok akêh, long e varơuq padoh hlolh. Dayh xôq tôôy varơuq xalih vlôh wih truh varơuq rôôk đơ. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Jơq be kơyq nưq đnooy apok akêh, yôôych tôôy yưk vaarq long 'ngưng yưk laa pe adro, tyauq thưq tưq, ji muuyq adro pheq padoh hlolh. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Măn atoh leh e adro padoh hlolh, yôôych adro nưq pheq hnhep đom tayuup vah. Tađôôy muut đnư, dayh đnooy dii kadih xăk ji dii Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Măn khơl adro jah vanong đnooy hlit, dayh xôq vaarq long pe adro đnooy vlôh, ji khơl adro kadrơy pheq 'yo hlê. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Bơh atoh e varơuq kajoq jah kahnoq vlôh ka muuyq kơyq nưq kadrơy đong 'ngôôy anguk, yôôych adro thưq nhưk pheq hnhep apok. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Vii dêq hloay hnoq ik đnooy hlit tưng adro muuyq, xôq tôôy adro hnoq ik hok xet ji tôôy adro jah ahmưk nhăk. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Danưng kooy ku khơl hlit chiuq tameng tyauq khơl hlit. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Vii Kơy Plêêk leh aalq laa ku varơuq lôônq xôônq, đơu laa ku varơuq tagu hlê.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Đaji đom dêq hloay tayuup vah ku khơl vah, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />khơl drê pheq hnhep hlê đom tayuup vah. Vii oot leh ik pheep đnooy, đơu pheq tameng tyauq, kung đaji ganuun pato. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Bơh atoh oot trôôch hok xet varơuq kajoq, yôôych oot pheq vôôch kanau ku oot măn hnhư, vii dik laa đangq kamưưl đôôyq dii khơl drê tok apok đom tayuup Vah. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Long apok ku Kơy Plêêk vlôh xing oh ay ih? Long apok Kadraq vơ truh dii oh ay đơu heq?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Atoh adro leq 'yo đaneq ni laa hnhư hlit long manih danưng kooy, yôôych adro nưq pheq nhonq xet đaneq kaluh varơuq gô valơk ka oh ay laa apok tanưưl ku Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Bơh atoh adro leq leh chiuq 'yo xet đanưq, yôôych dayh xôq adro nưq leh jah 'yo xet.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Jơq vii anưq, wơơy oh ay, dayh thaal trôôch đnooy hlit ji te kơmq đnooy apok akêh. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Bơh dayh dưk dơơp tôôy varơuq kach dong troq ji đom e rêêp.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Wơơy oh ay, gô kahnoq ka oh ay xet truh Hêêl Kaxay đơu gô heq đnooy vlôh ka oh ay, laa varơuq đơu oh ay kung heq nhonq xok, ji dưk kajưk tol nưq, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />kung xing Hêêl Kaxay nưq đơu oh ay jah wơơt, atoh oh ay rôp kajưk xok hêêl kaxay đơu gô heq padoh taboon ka oh ay, atoh leh aalq anưq, yôôych oh ay heq tuôq kach đaji hloh. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Vii đom sôôq kaluh varơuq adroyq nhưk gô heq pato ka oh ay, laa varơuq đơu gô kung heq nhonq xok — nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt vii kadrôôp maroh ku haay tyauq apok Rahlăp Vah, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Kadraq heq biq up, ji heq jah khienq riirh hlê muut hngơy thưq pe tyauq apok Rahlăp Vah, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />ji Kadraq heq rama vlôh ka Sê-pha, yôôch ka kưl vaarq adro jah rơơlh. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq heq kahnoq xăk ka 'ngưng iaq dăp hreek oh ay 'yo hloq kung muuyq yưk, đa sôôq 'ngưng adro đom sôôq oot juneq đong măn riirh, bơh muuyq sôôq heq vik. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq heq rama vlôh ka Ja-kơ, yôôch ka dêq hloay khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Nưq yôôch, dong truh lôôch dik ku tôôy manih, Kadraq kung heq kahnoq xăk ka gô 'yo hloq, đaji laa ka muuyq adro oh pa iir kaxeq. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Vii gô laa adro de nhưk đom khơl jah rơơlh, laa adro be e xưngq đangq kajoq xôq jah taayh laa adro jah rơơlh, vii gô heq rôp toop tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Bơh bơyh vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk đơu gô laa kadih gô juneq, ji vanong plêêk ku kadraq đom gô be aalq laa đaji hloh. Tađôôy muut đnư, gô heq pơơl hwơơl 'ngưng galơh iaq dêq hloay khơl kơy nưq, bơh leh aalq gô, đơu laa vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk măn dii gô. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Anưq, ju laa gô long laa khơl kơy nưq, yôôych 'wot padoh taboon đanưq ji oh ay heq tuôq đanưq.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Lunư, atoh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh jah padoh taboon đaneq Kadraq heq jah khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, yôôych dơơp aleq muuyq sôôq adro đom oh ay đnooy đaneq leh e varơuq riirh hlê ku manih kaxêêt? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Bơh atoh leh e varơuq riirh hlê ku manih kaxêêt, yôôych hloay kaah Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung heq leh jah khienq riirh hlê; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />đơu atoh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq leh jah khienq riirh hlê, yôôych varơuq pato dayq ku 'wot laa đaji hloh, ji xuum tuôq ku oh ay kung be ik xung liq. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Măn 'wot pheq đnooy biq 'yo laa taleq adro dơơp xanưk pa ôôh ku Kơy Plêêk, vii 'wot heq dơơp xanưk truh Kơy Plêêk đaneq Kadraq heq khienq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh riirh hlê, lunưq atoh đaji manih kaxêêt leh jah dơơp ka riirh hlê, yôôych Kadraq heq be khienq Kơy nưq riirh hlê. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Vii atoh manih kaxêêt leh jah dơơp ka riirh hlê, yôôych hloay kaah Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung heq leh jah khienq riirh hlê, <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />đơu atoh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq leh jah khienq riirh hlê, yôôych xuum tuôq ku oh ay laa đaji hloh; oh ay đong măn ja đom kadrôôp maroh oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Lunưq khơl adro heq vik đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung biq hư hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Atoh haay e takôô gamưh aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh vơ đom đơơy riirh neq, yôôych haay laa khơl adro đangq tarôôy iaq dêq đom dêq hloay tôôy manih.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Bơh juneq, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq jah khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, laa play droyq dik ku khơl adro heq vik. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Bơyh vii gamưh muuyq adro đơu e varơuq kaxêêt, yôôych kung gamưh muuyq adro đơu e varơuq riirh hlê ku adro kaxêêt. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Vii đaleq đom A-đam, tôôy manih raay kaxêêt, yôôych kung đanưq, đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, tôôy manih hnoq jah dơơp ka riirh. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Bơh tôôy adro tyauq thưq tưq đêh ku ni: Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa play droyq dik; atêq nưq laa khơl adro thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh muut tuôôy wiit truh hlê ku Kadraq. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Atêq nưq hnoq laa varơuq lôôch dik, tuôôy Kadraq pahnăp daak dêh hlê ka Kơy Plêêk laa Vaq, tuôôy Kadraq heq păk kaxêêt dêq hloay qwuyen dưk xanok, kung tôôy qwuyen da uh ji qwuyen lưk. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Vii Kơy nưq pheq dưk xanok dong truh tuôôy Kadraq heq xôq dêq hloay khơl adro tachơơl hlê 'laarq jôôk kadraq. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Khơl tachơơl lôôch dik biq păk kaxêêt laa varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Vii “Kadraq heq xôq tôôy paroh 'laarq jôôk kadraq.” Bơh tuôôy đnooy đaneq “Kadraq heq xôq tôôy paroh,” yôôych ro raang laa leh jauq e Kơy khienq tôôy paroh tameng tyauq Kadraq. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tôôy paroh heq biq rôp pheq tameng tyauq Kadraq, yôôych tuôôy nưq, kadih Koot kung hnoq chiuq tameng tyauq Kơy heq rôp tôôy paroh tameng tyauq kadraq, xôq Kơy Plêêk hnoq ik laa dêq hloay đom tôôy varơuq.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Atoh leh aalq anưq, yôôych khơl adro chiuq bap-tem thay ka adro kaxêêt hnoq dơơp kajoq? Atoh adro kaxêêt leh dong dik jah khienq ăm riirh hlê, yôôych vii aleq taleq adro nưq chiuq bap-tem thay ka khơl adro hơq? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Yôôch vii aleq 'wot chiuq ngwi hiêmh tôôy wat? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Oh ay lơơy, gô kaxêêt tôôy hngơy, vii varơuq mưng me truh oh ay, laa varơuq gô e đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Atoh đaji tyauq kach ku koot manih, gô heq damưq dii kaluh ôô gôk aduq Ê-phê-sô, yôôych varơuq ich lơơy kajoq deng ka gô? Atoh adro kaxêêt be jah khienq riirh hlê, yôôych “Dayh xa ji hôôch, vii hngơy dơh haay kaxêêt.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Te xôq biq aluut pa ôôh: “Khơl adro 'wơyq xơuq dơơp hư hlơơp kaluh katik kaxay.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Dayh talăng jăk wiit hlê đaji đangq pheq e! Ji te dơơp đnoyq lôp kadrôôp. Vii muuyq sôôq adro be e hlolh xet kajoq truh Kơy Plêêk — Gô đnooy varơuq neq pato truh varơuq kamưưl ku oh ay.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Lunư, muuyq adro hơq hnoq dăt: “Adro kaxêêt jah khienq riirh hlê bơơn kach leq, đơu oot truh dii đa xăk xamơk kajoq?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Adro vlô apoop hơq lơơy! Thưq đơu ay taway paraay be ik dơơp ka riirh atoh ni leh kaxêêt hămq. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ji thưq ay taway paraay yôôych leh aalq dang xăk ni hnoq jêêk vlôh, wih hlê, ay taway paraay vơ laa kalook adreek — bơh ni hnoq ik laa kalook va away long kalook kadrơy. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk kahniq ka ni muuyq xăk ưk xatyauq iq Kadraq trôôch, ji ka tôôy kalook adreek muuyq xăk ưk đêh raa. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Be aalq tôôy xăk xamơk laa kung muuyq xăk xamơk. Wih hlê laa xăk xamơk đêh raa ku koot manih, xăk xamơk đêh raa ku kaluh ôô gôk, xăk xamơk đêh raa ku kaluh paroh xêêp ji xăk xamơk đêh raa ku kaluh paroh kaa. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kung e kaluh xăk xamơk tol plêêk ji kaluh xăk xamơk 'laarq vari, Lunư, tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq plêêk laa luneq, măn tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq vari laa đahơq. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Tađnah tađnaak ku mot hngơy laa luneq, tađnah tađnaak ku xiêk laa đahơq, ji tađnah tađnaak ku kaluh xalok yôôych đêh đnoyq. Vii xalok neq đêh raa dii xalok hơq truh tađnah tađnaak. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Varơuq riirh hlê ku manih kaxêêt kung đanưq. Xăk xamơk jah up pôôt đom ka varơuq oop hruh, xăk xamơk jah riirh hlê đom ka varơuq paq kaxêêt; <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />jah paraay pôôt đom kamưưl ier; jah riirh hlê đom tađnah tađnaak; jah paraay pôôt đom ravoch, jah riirh hlê đom taay yaak; <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />jah paraay pôôt laa xăk xamơk khiêk hlek, jah riirh hlê laa xăk xamơk thiêêng liêng. Atoh e xăk xamơk khiêk hlek, yôôych kung e xăk xamơk thiêêng liêng. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Lunưq kung e apok valơk: “Adro adroyq dik laa A-đam heq jêêk vlôh phool hiel riirh.” A-đam lôôch dik laa yaak kahniq varơuq riirh. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Bơh leh aalq xăk xamơk thiêêng liêng e adroyq, đơu laa xăk xamơk khiêk hlek, atêq nưq đơơu truh xăk xamơk thiêêng liêng. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Manih thưq nhưk vlôh xing vari, laa manih thuôk xuq vari. Manih thưq vaarq truh xing plêêk. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Manih thuôk xuq vari nưq đaleq, yôôych khơl adro thuôk xuq vari kung đanưq; ji Kơy thuôk xuq plêêk đaleq, yôôych khơl adro thuôk xuq plêêk kung đanưq. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Đaji haay heq kanôôp long lơuq ku manih thuôk xuq vari, yôôych haay kung duh kanôôp long lơuq ku Kơy thuôk xuq plêêk.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Panưh kadrơy, wơơy oh ay, gô xiin đnooy varơuq neq, đaneq hlek ji vahaap leh ik nhonq jah daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk. Raay hư hlơơp kung be nhonq jah varơuq leh hư hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />'Yo ne, gô ăm oh ay xet muuyq varơuq kadook: Be aalq dêq hloay haay hnoq vik, bơh dêq hloay haay hnoq jah tađôôy đơơu, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />đom ka'mek mot, đom kableuh mot, muut ahlôôk keeng lôôch. Vii keeng hnoq ahna tok, ji khơl adro kaxêêt hnoq jah khienq riirh hlê đom varơuq leh hư hlơơp, yôôch haay hnoq jah tađôôy đơơu. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Vii băt dăt xăk xamơk hư hlơơp neq hlưp xok varơuq leh hư hlơơp, ji xăk xamơk pheq kaxêêt neq hlưp xok varơuq leh kaxêêt hlơơp. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Yôôch tuôôy xăk xamơk hư hlơơp neq heq hlưp xok varơuq leh hư hlơơp, ji xăk xamơk pheq kaxêêt neq heq hlưp xok varơuq leh kaxêêt hlơơp, yôôych tuôôy nưq, apok heq valơk hnoq xalih vlôh, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:54">“Varơuq kaxêêt heq biq luôôt apoop đom varơuq jah jay.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Wơơy varơuq kaxêêt, varơuq jah jay ku may măn 'leq?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Wơơy varơuq kaxêêt, nok đôk ku may măn 'leq?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Đơu nok đôk ku varơuq kaxêêt laa kadrôôp maroh, măn qwuyen paraat ku kadrôôp maroh laa ganuun. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Bơh tưp tok Kơy Plêêk apok kuh kway, Kơy kahniq ka haay varơuq jah jay gamưh Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu! <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Vii anưq, oh ay xung xiaq ku gô lơơy, dayh jêêk vlôh dưk kajưk, leh ahluch tađôôy, tuôôy hloay hloay raah jôh đom varơuq dơơp Lôôk, vii xet đaneq varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku oh ay be aalq laa đaji hloh đom Lôôk.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Truh varơuq tagoop ka khơl vah, tyauq đaji gô heq pato jarooy ka kaluh tayuup vah dêh Ga-la-ti, oh ay kung dayh dơơp đanưq. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Tôôy hngơy droyq dik đom twuân, tưng adro đom oh ay dayh xôq đêh vlôh, tuôôy tagoop tuôông vâk leq nưq atoh adro nưq jah kahniq tuôông vâk, xôq tuôôy gô truh, hnoq leh duh pheq tagoop kajoq đnoyq tuôôy nưq. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Panưh kadrơy, tuôôy gô truh, atoh oh ay ưng chiuq khơl adro leq, yôôych gô hnoq patăk dăt oot xagook kadrool ku oh ay kung dii hla thư truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Măn atoh varơuq nưq kung laa varơuq đangq xôq gô pheq hooy, yôôych oot hnoq vlôh hooy dii gô. <verse eid="1CO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Bơh gô hnoq truh dii oh ay atêq tuôôy gô heq hooy dalơh Ma-xê-đoan, vii gô đong hooy dalơh hlê Ma-xê-đoan. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Yôôch hnoq ik gô hnoq măn hlê dii oh ay, long pheq đnooy dalơh hlê tuôôt xiêk ka oaq, xôq oh ay hnoq ik jarooy gô dưk hooy atoh gô duh hooy maleq nưq. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Vii gô leh trôôch tavơh oh ay juneq tol trôôk hooy dalơh hlê, vii gô takôô gamưh kưq măn dii oh ay muuyq kawat, atoh Lôôk ăm pheep. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Bơh gô hnoq măn hlê aduq Ê-phê-sô dong truh Lêh Nguh Twuân, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />vii muuyq poop 'mok ranưh ji raak play heq luh vlôh ka gô, đơu 'ngưng ưng kadrơy yôôych đong klơl đơ gô.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Panưh kadrơy, atoh Ti-mô-thê truh, dayh tabông truh xôq ay nưq măn dii oh ay tyauq kach leh kajoq pheq kamưưl ier, vii ay nưq đong dơơp varơuq Lôôk, dang đaji gô. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Jo nưq, be muuyq adro leq ik 'yo leh ra kajoq ay nưq. Bơh dayh waak ay nưq dưk hooy hrok hrol, xôq ay nưq hnoq ik truh dii gô, vii gô đong takôô ay nưq kung dii khơl oh ay kadrơy. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Măn truh adro oh ay A-bô-lô, gô heq vlôh paraat ahmưk nhăk ay nưq xôq ka ay nưq truh dii oh ay kung khơl oh ay kadrơy, đơu nưq leh aalq laa iq trôôch ku ay nưq kajoq dêq aleq ka ay nưq truh muut tuôôy neq. Lunư ay nưq hnoq truh tuôôy e kawah.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Dayh văch 'yo; dayh dưk kajưk đom xuum tuôq; dayh kôk kalh đangq adro khơl kanau; dayh kalh paraat. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Dayh xôq tôôy varơuq ku oh ay jah xalih vlôh đom xuum xung xiaq.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Panưh kadrơy, wơơy oh ay, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay (oh ay xet manih hnhư ku Sê-pha-na, đaneq oot laa play droyq dik aduq A-chai, ji oot heq kadih pahnăp xăk muut varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq khơl vah), <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />xôq ka oh ay kung tameng tyauq khơl adro đanưq kung dêq hloay khơl leq đong kung varơuq dơơp ji pơơl hwơơl. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Gô hlah hlaak truh varơuq Sê-pha-na, Phôt-tu-na ji A-chai-kơ truh, vii oot heq athêêp muut varơuq kajoq măn thiuq xing aduq oh ay; <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />vii oot heq dơơp đơơu hlê danưng kooy ku gô ji ku oh ay. Nưq, dayh 'yo nhonq khơl adro đanưq.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Kaluh tayuup vah dêh A-si atăq apok vôôch hrok truh oh ay. A-qui-la ji Bê-rit-sin, kung dii tayuup vah tagumq aduq hnhư ku oot, dêq xuum vôôch hrok oh ay đom Lôôk. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Dêq hloay khơl oh ay vôôch hlơq oh ay. Dayh vôôch hrok mamuuyq bơơn hiip vah.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Apok hlơq neq laa bơyh kadih ti gô — Phao-lô. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Atoh adro leq leh xung xiaq Lôôk, yôôych adro nưq pheq chiuq varơuq karoay axaap! Kuh Lôôk 'wot koot, xiin Kadraq truh! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Apôôy vôôch vanong plêêk ku Lôôk Jê-xu măn dii oh ay. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Xuum xung xiaq ku gô măn dii dêq hloay oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Amen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>